      "justification": "Patient presents with cough, fever, dyspnea and has structural lung disease. Diagnostic workup (CBC, BMP, CXR, blood cultures, sputum cultures, procalcitonin, legionella antigen, CURB-65) has been completed. Empiric antibiotic therapy with beta-lactam plus macrolide is the standard CAP regimen per IDSA/ATS guidelines, especially appropriate for a patient with structural lung disease. Labs are pending but treatment should not be delayed further at 55 minutes post-arrival."
