      "justification": "Patient has structural lung disease (comorbidity) with community-acquired pneumonia presentation (cough, fever, dyspnea). IDSA/ATS guidelines recommend respiratory fluoroquinolone as an alternative/adjunct antibiotic regimen for CAP in patients with structural lung disease, as beta-lactam plus macrolide may not provide adequate coverage for organisms like Pseudomonas in this population."
    },
